  "title": "Slow Cooker Lamb Stew with Butternut Squash and Marsala Wine",
  "description": "Savory broth, Marsala wine, fresh thyme, and rosemary blend with butternut squash and lamb in the slow cooker to create a great tasting winter stew.",
  "authors": [
    "Dan Toomey"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-12-02T01:20:50-05:00",
